#. location to the object which currently has focus.
#: src/orca/cmdnames.py:136
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Move flat review to the home position"
msgid "Move flat review to the object with focus"
msgstr "Die Übersicht zur Ausgangsposition bewegen"

#. Translators: the 'flat review' feature of Orca allows the blind user to
#. explore the text in a window in a 2D fashion.  That is, Orca treats all
#. the text from all objects in a window (e.g., buttons, labels, etc.) as a
#. sequence of words in a sequence of lines.  This command moves focus to the
#. object at the current flat review location.
#: src/orca/cmdnames.py:143
msgid "Move focus to the flat review location"
